@local/dsh-session-multiselect README · English：A portable DSH web-client plugin adding file-manager-style range multi-selection to the session
sidebar (Shift+click first→last), with batch archive (undo/unarchive). The repo root is the plugin;
see `SKILL.md` for install/port instructions.

